{"seq":3,"slug":"init-residual","title":"初始化与残差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/init-residual","wordCount":1627,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"初始化与残差\">初始化与残差</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/backprop-autodiff\">反向传播</a>每经过一层就乘上该层的局部导数，几十层连乘后梯度极易指数级缩小或放大——这就是梯度消失与梯度爆炸，深网难训的最根本数值病因。<a href=\"normalization\">归一化</a>从中途平滑梯度流，但还有两件事要从源头做对：一是参数的初始值要让信号在前向与反向传播中都保持合理方差，二是网络结构要给梯度开一条不衰减的回传通路。前者是初始化，后者是残差连接。这一节讲清这两根让「深」真正成为可能的支柱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-方差守恒\">核心概念：方差守恒</h2><p>把信号在网络里的传播看成方差的逐层变换。若每一层都让激活的方差略微放大，几十层后就会爆炸；略微缩小，则会消失。初始化的目标，就是选择权重的初始分布，使得前向激活的方差与反向梯度的方差都尽量逐层守恒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[随机初始化权重] --&gt; B{方差是否逐层守恒}&#10;  B --&gt;|放大| C[激活/梯度指数爆炸&lt;br/&gt;loss 变 NaN]&#10;  B --&gt;|缩小| D[激活/梯度指数消失&lt;br/&gt;深层学不动]&#10;  B --&gt;|守恒| E[信号稳定穿越几十层]&#10;  E --&gt; F[残差连接&lt;br/&gt;给梯度开高速公路]&#10;  F --&gt; G[几百上千层端到端可训]\">flowchart TD\n  A[随机初始化权重] --&gt; B{方差是否逐层守恒}\n  B --&gt;|放大| C[激活/梯度指数爆炸&lt;br/&gt;loss 变 NaN]\n  B --&gt;|缩小| D[激活/梯度指数消失&lt;br/&gt;深层学不动]\n  B --&gt;|守恒| E[信号稳定穿越几十层]\n  E --&gt; F[残差连接&lt;br/&gt;给梯度开高速公路]\n  F --&gt; G[几百上千层端到端可训]</pre><p>考虑一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 维输入、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 维输出的线性层。要让前向方差守恒，需权重方差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；要让反向梯度方差守恒，需约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。Xavier（Glorot）初始化取二者折中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(W)=2/(n_{in}+n_{out})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，适用于 tanh、sigmoid 这类关于零对称的激活。</p>\n<p>把这套方差守恒的推理写成代码，三种初始化的区别只是一个缩放因子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def init_(w, kind):&#10;    n_in, n_out = w.shape[1], w.shape[0]&#10;    if kind == &quot;xavier&quot;:      # 折中前后向：适配 tanh/sigmoid&#10;        std = (2.0 / (n_in + n_out)) ** 0.5&#10;    elif kind == &quot;kaiming&quot;:   # 补偿 ReLU 砍掉的一半方差&#10;        std = (2.0 / n_in) ** 0.5&#10;    elif kind == &quot;residual&quot;:  # 残差分支按层数缩放，初始近似恒等&#10;        std = (1.0 / n_in) ** 0.5 / (2 * n_layers) ** 0.5&#10;    with torch.no_grad():&#10;        w.normal_(0, std)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, kind):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_in, n_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], w.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"xavier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 折中前后向：适配 tanh/sigmoid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n_in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_out)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"kaiming\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 补偿 ReLU 砍掉的一半方差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_in) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"residual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 残差分支按层数缩放，初始近似恒等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_in) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_layers) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w.normal_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, std)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键不是分布的具体形式，而是那个由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与激活函数共同决定的缩放因子——它决定了信号能否在几十层里保住方差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kaiming-初始化-为-relu-而生\">Kaiming 初始化：为 ReLU 而生</h2><p>ReLU 会把一半的激活置零，相当于砍掉一半方差，Xavier 的假设不再成立。Kaiming（He）初始化据此修正，把方差放大一倍以补偿：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(W) = \\frac{2}{n_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个看似微小的因子 2，让上百层的 ReLU 网络得以稳定训练，是深度卷积网络时代的关键一步。下表对比主流初始化方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>初始化</th>\n<th>权重方差</th>\n<th>适配激活</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Xavier/Glorot</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/(n_{in}+n_{out})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>tanh、sigmoid</td>\n<td>早期网络、RNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kaiming/He</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/n_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>ReLU 及变体</td>\n<td>深度 CNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正交初始化</td>\n<td>正交矩阵</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>RNN、稳定梯度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小尺度/缩放初始化</td>\n<td>按深度缩小</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>大模型残差分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对 Transformer，常见做法是把残差分支的输出投影初始化得更小（如按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{2L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这类与层数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 相关的因子缩放），让网络初始时近似恒等映射，从而避免深层叠加导致的激活爆炸——这把初始化与残差结构紧紧绑在一起。另一个细节是嵌入层与输出层常用更小的标准差初始化（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.02</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span></span></span></span></span>），因为它们的维度极大、对整体尺度影响显著。这些看似琐碎的缩放因子，恰恰是大模型能否在第一步就稳住的分水岭：初始化错一个量级，再好的优化器与调度也救不回开局就发散的训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"残差连接-给梯度的高速公路\">残差连接：给梯度的高速公路</h2><p>即便初始化完美，纯粹堆叠的深网仍会退化——层数越多，训练误差反而上升，并非过拟合而是优化困难。残差连接的解法极简：让每个子层学习「相对恒等映射的增量」而非完整变换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x + F(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是子层（如卷积块或注意力块），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是直接跳过来的输入。反向传播时，梯度可以沿着这个加法分支不经衰减地直接回传到浅层——相当于给梯度修了一条高速公路。这从根本上缓解了梯度消失，让几百上千层的网络第一次能端到端训练，也呼应了<a href=\"../foundations/optimization-landscape\">损失地形可视化</a>中观察到的：带残差的网络损失曲面明显更平滑。</p>\n<p>从反向传播看，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+F(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的雅可比是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I + \\partial F/\\partial x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，那个恒等项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 保证了梯度至少能以原样回传，不会因连乘而指数衰减。围绕残差也有几个常见反模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>残差分支不加缩放地大初始化</td>\n<td>深层激活随层数爆炸</td>\n<td>按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{2L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等因子缩小残差分支输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用 Post-Norm 叠很深的网络</td>\n<td>梯度不稳，需极小学习率与长预热</td>\n<td>改用 Pre-Norm，让残差路径保持干净</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>残差分支里塞入改变维度的操作</td>\n<td>加法两侧形状不匹配，连接失效</td>\n<td>用投影或恒等映射把维度对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只堆残差不做预热</td>\n<td>开局仍可能发散</td>\n<td>残差 + 初始化 + 预热配套使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>残差的价值不在「多一条线」，而在它把深网优化的病态程度从指数级拉回到可控的常数级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"残差-归一化与初始化的协同\">残差、归一化与初始化的协同</h2><p>残差从不单独工作，它与<a href=\"normalization\">归一化的位置</a>深度耦合。Pre-Norm 布局 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x + F(\\mathrm{Norm}(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Norm</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 让残差通路保持「干净」，梯度回传最顺畅，是现代大模型的默认；Post-Norm 则把归一化放在相加之后，深层更易不稳，对<a href=\"../optimizers/lr-scheduling\">学习率预热</a>和初始化更挑剔。</p>\n<p>这就把本章三节串成了一套组合拳：初始化保证信号一开始方差守恒，残差为梯度开通不衰减的回传通路，归一化在中途持续平滑分布。三者缺一，超深网络的稳定训练都会打折扣。它们也是<a href=\"../scaling/large-batch-distributed\">大批量分布式训练</a>能把模型铺到上千卡而不发散的前提——没有这套稳定基础，规模化无从谈起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>梯度消失与爆炸源于反向传播的逐层连乘，初始化与残差从源头治理这一数值病因。</li>\n<li>初始化的目标是方差守恒：Xavier 适配对称激活，Kaiming 为 ReLU 把方差加倍补偿置零损失。</li>\n<li>Transformer 常把残差分支按深度缩小初始化，让网络初始近似恒等，避免深层激活爆炸。</li>\n<li>残差连接 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+F(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 给梯度开一条不衰减的高速公路，解决了深网退化、让上千层端到端可训。</li>\n<li>初始化、残差、归一化三者协同（Pre-Norm 为默认），是超深网络稳定训练与后续规模化的共同前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"初始化与残差","id":"初始化与残差"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：方差守恒","id":"核心概念-方差守恒"},{"level":2,"text":"Kaiming 初始化：为 ReLU 而生","id":"kaiming-初始化-为-relu-而生"},{"level":2,"text":"残差连接：给梯度的高速公路","id":"残差连接-给梯度的高速公路"},{"level":2,"text":"残差、归一化与初始化的协同","id":"残差-归一化与初始化的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"正则化与 Dropout","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/regularization"},"next":{"title":"混合精度与梯度缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/scaling/mixed-precision"}}